"Turn off Improve Siri and Dictation" = "关闭“改进 Siri 与听写”";
"Stops Apple storing and reviewing recordings of your Siri and dictation requests." = "阻止 Apple 存储和审查你的 Siri 与听写请求的录音。";
"Turn off Improve Search" = "关闭“改进搜索”";
"Stops Apple keeping your Spotlight, Safari and Look Up searches to improve search." = "阻止 Apple 保留你的 Spotlight、Safari 和“查询”搜索以改进搜索。";
"Turn off Spotlight internet results" = "关闭 Spotlight 互联网结果";
"Keeps Spotlight searches on your Mac instead of sending them to Apple for web suggestions." = "让 Spotlight 搜索保留在你的 Mac 上，而不是发送给 Apple 获取网页建议。";
"Turn off Look Up suggestions" = "关闭“查询”建议";
"Stops Look Up sending the words you select to Apple for web results." = "阻止“查询”将你选中的词语发送给 Apple 获取网页结果。";
"Turn off Safari search suggestions" = "关闭 Safari 搜索建议";
"Stops Safari sending what you type in the address bar to your search engine and to Apple." = "阻止 Safari 将你在地址栏中输入的内容发送给搜索引擎和 Apple。";
"The address bar no longer suggests searches as you type." = "地址栏在你输入时不再提供搜索建议。";
"Turn off Game Center" = "关闭 Game Center";
"Turns Game Center off, with its sign-in prompts, friend requests and notifications." = "关闭 Game Center，包括其登录提示、好友请求和通知。";
"Games that need Game Center to save progress or play online lose that." = "需要 Game Center 才能保存进度或联机游玩的游戏会失去相应功能。";
"Stop clicks on the wallpaper hiding windows" = "阻止点击墙纸隐藏窗口";
"Stops every window sliding away when you click the wallpaper by mistake." = "阻止误点墙纸时所有窗口滑开。";
"Hide desktop widgets" = "隐藏桌面小组件";
"Hides widgets on the desktop, including in Stage Manager." = "隐藏桌面上的小组件，包括在“台前调度”中。";
"Turn off the play, pause and skip keys" = "关闭播放、暂停和跳转按键";
"Turns off the service behind the media keys, so the play key can't open Music." = "关闭媒体键背后的服务，这样播放键就不会打开“音乐”。";
"The keys stop working in every app, including VLC and Spotify. To keep them and only stop Music opening, use Stop Music from opening instead." = "这些按键会在所有应用（包括 VLC 和 Spotify）中失效。若想保留它们、仅阻止打开“音乐”，请改用“阻止音乐打开”。";
"Stop Music from opening, even by hand" = "阻止“音乐”打开，即使手动也不行";
"Disables Music's application launch entry, so an AirPod press no longer opens it. No background helper or configuration profile is installed." = "禁用“音乐”的应用启动入口，这样按 AirPods 就不再打开它。不会安装后台助手或配置文件。";
"Music won't open at all, not even when you click it, until you undo this. Reapply after a macOS update replaces Music's files." = "“音乐”将完全无法打开（即使点击也不行），直到你撤销此设置。macOS 更新替换“音乐”的文件后需重新应用。";
"Turn off iPhone Mirroring" = "关闭 iPhone 镜像";
"Turns iPhone Mirroring off, so the app and its prompts go away." = "关闭 iPhone 镜像，使其应用和提示都消失。";
"Turn off Apple Music in the Music app" = "在“音乐”应用中关闭 Apple Music";
"Turns the Music app back into a plain player for your own library, without the store and subscription prompts." = "让“音乐”应用变回仅播放自己资料库的普通播放器，不再有商店和订阅提示。";
"Apple Music subscribers lose streaming." = "Apple Music 订阅用户将无法在线播放。";
"Turn off the Book Store" = "关闭书店";
"Removes the store from the Books app and keeps your own books." = "从“图书”应用中移除商店，保留你自己的书籍。";
"Remove unused Apple apps from the Dock" = "从 Dock 移除不使用的 Apple 应用";
"Removes News, TV, Music, Podcasts, Books, Freeform, Image Playground, Journal, Maps and Stocks from the Dock. The apps stay installed." = "从 Dock 移除“新闻”、TV、“音乐”、“播客”、“图书”、Freeform、Image Playground、“日记”、“地图”和“股市”。这些应用仍保持安装。";
"Show file extensions" = "显示文件扩展名";
"Shows the full name of every file, so a file pretending to be a document is easier to spot." = "显示每个文件的完整名称，这样更容易识破伪装成文档的文件。";
"Show hidden files" = "显示隐藏文件";
"Shows the files macOS hides, such as .gitignore and .zshrc. Press Command-Shift-Period to toggle it too." = "显示 macOS 隐藏的文件，例如 .gitignore 和 .zshrc。也可按 Command-Shift-句号来切换。";
"Show the path bar" = "显示路径栏";
"Shows where the current folder is at the bottom of every Finder window." = "在每个 Finder 窗口底部显示当前文件夹的位置。";
"Show the status bar" = "显示状态栏";
"Shows the number of items and the free space at the bottom of Finder windows." = "在 Finder 窗口底部显示项目数量和可用空间。";
"Keep folders above files" = "文件夹保持在文件上方";
"Keeps folders above files when sorting by name." = "按名称排序时，让文件夹排在文件上方。";
"Search the current folder" = "搜索当前文件夹";
"Makes Finder search the folder you're in, not the whole Mac." = "让 Finder 搜索你所在的文件夹，而不是整个 Mac。";
"Skip the extension change warning" = "跳过更改扩展名的警告";
"Stops Finder asking for confirmation each time you change a file's extension." = "阻止 Finder 在每次更改文件扩展名时要求确认。";
"Show the full path in the title bar" = "在标题栏显示完整路径";
"Shows the full folder path at the top of Finder windows." = "在 Finder 窗口顶部显示完整文件夹路径。";
"Stop .DS_Store files on network drives" = "禁止在网络驱动器上生成 .DS_Store 文件";
"Stops Finder leaving .DS_Store files in shared folders on other computers." = "阻止 Finder 在其他计算机的共享文件夹中留下 .DS_Store 文件。";
"Empty the Trash after 30 days" = "30 天后清空废纸篓";
"Deletes items that have been in the Trash for 30 days, so it stops filling the disk." = "删除已在废纸篓中存放 30 天的项目，以免它继续占用磁盘。";
"Save new documents on this Mac" = "将新文档存储在这台 Mac 上";
"Makes Save dialogs start on your Mac instead of iCloud Drive." = "让“存储”对话框默认定位到你的 Mac，而不是 iCloud 云盘。";
"Expand Save dialogs" = "展开“存储”对话框";
"Opens Save dialogs with the full folder browser instead of the small version." = "以完整文件夹浏览方式打开“存储”对话框，而不是小窗口。";
"Show the Library folder" = "显示“资源库”文件夹";
"Shows the hidden Library folder in your home folder." = "显示个人文件夹中隐藏的“资源库”文件夹。";
"Hide recent apps in the Dock" = "在 Dock 中隐藏最近使用的应用";
"Stops the Dock adding apps you opened recently." = "阻止 Dock 添加你最近打开的应用。";
"Remove the Dock auto-hide delay" = "移除 Dock 自动隐藏延迟";
"Shows a hidden Dock straight away instead of after half a second." = "让隐藏的 Dock 立即显示，而不是等半秒。";
"Stop Dock icons bouncing" = "停止 Dock 图标跳动";
"Stops Dock icons bouncing while apps open." = "阻止 Dock 图标在应用打开时跳动。";
"Minimize windows into their app icon" = "将窗口最小化到其应用图标";
"Keeps minimized windows inside their app's icon instead of filling the Dock." = "让最小化的窗口留在其应用图标内，而不是占满 Dock。";
"Turn off window opening animations" = "关闭窗口打开动画";
"Opens new windows instantly instead of zooming them in." = "立即打开新窗口，而不是以缩放动画展开。";
"Remove gaps between tiled windows" = "移除平铺窗口之间的间隙";
"Removes the margins around windows you tile to the sides of the screen." = "移除你贴靠到屏幕边缘的窗口周围的边距。";
"Remove shadows from window screenshots" = "移除窗口截图的阴影";
"Takes window screenshots without the large drop shadow around them." = "截取窗口时不带周围的大投影。";
"Turn off autocorrect" = "关闭自动纠正";
"Stops macOS correcting words as you type." = "阻止 macOS 在你输入时纠正词语。";
"Turn off smart quotes and dashes" = "关闭智能引号和破折号";
"Keeps straight quotes and double hyphens as you typed them, which code and terminals need." = "保留你输入的直引号和双连字符，这是代码和终端所需要的。";
"Turn off period on double space" = "关闭双击空格输入句号";
"Stops two spaces turning into a period." = "阻止两个空格变成句号。";
"Turn off automatic capitals" = "关闭自动大写";
"Stops macOS capitalizing the first word of each sentence." = "阻止 macOS 将每个句子的首词大写。";
"Repeat held keys instead of showing accents" = "按住按键重复输入，而不是显示重音菜单";
"Repeats a key while you hold it, instead of opening the accent menu." = "按住按键时重复输入，而不是打开重音菜单。";
"Type accents with Option shortcuts or the Character Viewer instead." = "可改用 Option 快捷键或“字符检视器”输入重音。";
"Aerial wallpaper videos" = "航拍墙纸视频";
"Videos for the moving aerial wallpapers and screen savers. macOS downloads one again when you choose it." = "动态航拍墙纸和屏幕保护程序的视频。当你选择时，macOS 会重新下载。";
"You use an aerial wallpaper or screen saver now, so macOS will download it again." = "你当前正在使用航拍墙纸或屏幕保护程序，因此 macOS 会重新下载它。";
"macOS installers" = "macOS 安装程序";
"Old \"Install macOS\" apps left in Applications after an upgrade." = "升级后遗留在“应用程序”中的旧“安装 macOS”应用。";
"iPhone and iPad updates" = "iPhone 和 iPad 更新";
"Software update files Finder downloaded for iPhones and iPads. They download again when needed." = "Finder 为 iPhone 和 iPad 下载的软件更新文件。需要时会重新下载。";
"Xcode build data" = "Xcode 构建数据";
"Xcode's DerivedData folder. Xcode rebuilds it on the next build." = "Xcode 的 DerivedData 文件夹。Xcode 会在下次构建时重新生成。";
"Xcode device support" = "Xcode 设备支持";
"Debug symbols Xcode copied from each iPhone, iPad and Watch you connected. They copy again on the next connection." = "Xcode 从你连接过的每台 iPhone、iPad 和 Watch 复制的调试符号。下次连接时会重新复制。";
"Unavailable simulators" = "不可用的模拟器";
"Simulators for runtimes that are no longer installed, so they can't run." = "针对已不再安装的运行时环境的模拟器，因此无法运行。";
"Deleted right away, not moved to the Trash." = "会立即删除，而不是移入废纸篓。";
"App caches" = "应用缓存";
"Files apps keep to load faster. Apps rebuild them, so the first launch afterwards can be slower." = "应用为更快加载而保留的文件。应用会重新生成它们，因此之后首次启动可能较慢。";
"Quit your apps first. The macOS caches RemoveMacAI knows about are left alone." = "请先退出你的应用。RemoveMacAI 所了解的 macOS 缓存不会被处理。";
"One of Apple's optional apps. It reinstalls free from the App Store." = "Apple 的可选应用之一。可从 App Store 免费重新安装。";
"Time Machine local snapshots" = "Time Machine 本地快照";
"Hourly copies Time Machine keeps on this disk between backups. macOS counts them as System Data." = "Time Machine 在备份之间保存在此磁盘上的每小时副本。macOS 将其计入“系统数据”。";
"Deleted right away, not moved to the Trash. Your backups on the backup disk aren't touched." = "会立即删除，而不是移入废纸篓。备份磁盘上的备份不会受到影响。";
"1 snapshot" = "1 个快照";
"About %@. Items only an administrator can move ask for your password." = "约 %@。只有管理员才能移动的项目需要你输入密码。";
"%@ are deleted right away, not moved to the Trash." = "%@ 会立即删除，而不是移入废纸篓。";
"Installed" = "已安装";
"Background item: %@" = "后台项目：%@";
"You see every change first" = "你先看到每项更改";
"Nothing happens until you review the list and click Apply." = "在你查看列表并点击“应用”之前，不会发生任何更改。";
"Everything can be undone" = "一切都可以撤销";
"Undo puts every setting back. Deleted models download again when a feature needs them." = "“撤销”会恢复每项设置。当某项功能需要时，已删除的模型会重新下载。";
"Your Mac stays protected" = "你的 Mac 保持受保护";
