"You review every change before it happens" = "你会在每项更改发生前进行查看";
"Undo puts everything back" = "“撤销”会恢复一切";
"System Integrity Protection stays on" = "“系统完整性保护”保持开启";
"No network requests, no analytics" = "无网络请求、无分析数据";
"Wi-Fi" = "Wi-Fi";
"Bluetooth" = "蓝牙";
"Network" = "网络";
"Appearance" = "外观";
"Privacy & Security" = "隐私与安全性";
