" and %@ of models" = " 和 %@ 的模型";
"Nothing is selected for you" = "不会为你预先选择任何内容";
"Choose" = "选择";
"Pick a preset or switch single things off. Each one says what it does." = "选择预设，或单独关闭某些项目。每项都会说明其作用。";
"Review" = "查看";
"You see the full list and how much space comes back. Nothing has changed yet." = "你会看到完整列表和可回收的空间。目前尚未发生任何更改。";
"Approve" = "批准";
"macOS asks you to install a profile in System Settings. Only you can make that click." = "macOS 会要求你在“系统设置”中安装配置文件。只有你能完成这一步点击。";
"Debloats macOS and can undo every change.\n\nThe Apple Intelligence part builds on pared by 4evy, which first mapped Apple's asset service and model sets." = "精简 macOS，并可撤销每项更改。\n\nApple Intelligence 部分基于 4evy 的 pared，该项目最先摸清了 Apple 的资源服务和模型集。";
"Could not write the profile: %@" = "无法写入配置文件：%@";
